// Tier variants of buildings: this game's building suitability (docs/SUITABILITY.md; not in
//     FFH2). Each entry is a variant of the building variant_of names, at variant_tier
//     (building_tiers.jsonc): that building's entry with these keys in place of its own (a
//     key left out keeps the Standard building's value; a list or object replaces the whole
//     of the Standard one). The Standard building is the tier BUILDINGTIER_STANDARD.
//     A city builds only its tier's variant of a building (it rolls the tier per building
//     class at founding). The civilization buildings whose effects are in the rules' code
//     (Warrens, Planar Gate, Cave of Ancestors, ...) read their tier there (ffh-core
//     ffh/events.rs).
//     unlocked_unit_experience / unlocked_unit_production_modifier / unlocked_unit_promotion:
//         for the units the building unlocks (prereq_building of its family, or
//         prereq_building_class its class) trained in its city.
//     extra_free_promotion: a second free_promotion. bonus_yield_changes: the city's yield for
//         each listed bonus it has. population_commerces: commerce per citizen, in hundredths.
//     sentinel_repair_change: points added to SENTINEL_REPAIR_PERCENT in its city.
